{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55345","headline":"题东林二首 二 · 匡白","name":"题东林二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东林继四绝，物象更清幽。\n社客去不返，钟峰云也（《永乐大典》作「色」）秋。\n松枯羣狖散，溪大蠹槎流。\n待卜归休计，重来卧石楼。\n（见《吉石庵丛书》本《庐山记》卷四，以《永乐大典》卷八七八二引《九江府志》参校。\n）（按：《殷礼在斯堂丛书》校排本《庐山记》二诗题作《天祚二年三月十六日偶与幕客门馆僧道，闲游题东林二首》，系将徐知证等联句诗末题记误植於匡白诗题，另详後徐知证条。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"匡白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}